senses.gloss:
bhaṭṭā (f., which I do not find recorded, to bhaṭṭa, title of respect),
(1) lady (applied to a queen): bhaṭṭe, voc., Mv 〔ii.445.6〕; 〔447.7〕 (em); bhaṭṭāye, instr., 〔445.14〕 (em.);
(2) n. of a yakṣiṇī (cf. the yogeśvarī named Bhaṭṭā, Rājataraṅginī, ed. Stein, 〔i.331〕): Mmk 〔564.25〕 (read bhaṭṭā for ˚ṭa); 〔565.20〕 (˚ṭe, voc.).
